# Build output must never enter the image: a host `obj/` directory carries
# project.assets.json with absolute paths from another machine, and it
# overwrites the container's own restore.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/shots/

# Repositories and editor state
**/.git/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.cursor/

# Local environment and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/appsettings.Local.json

# Documentation that is not needed to build
**/*.md
!README.md
